
- Affected when the player is searching, investigating, examining objects, recalling lore,
  detecting magic, using Perception, studying something in the environment, hunting,
  foraging, tracking, gathering herbs or materials, identifying plants or creatures,
  or performing any Survival-based field activity.
- Hunting and foraging ALWAYS need mechanics (Survival check). Tracking needs mechanics
